WEBVTT

00:00:00.360 --> 00:00:02.035
Got a home in Lagos that

00:00:02.035 --> 00:00:03.642
sits empty some nights?

00:00:03.822 --> 00:00:05.152
HAMLET helps you fill those

00:00:05.172 --> 00:00:07.152
nights with verified guests.

00:00:07.172 --> 00:00:10.033
Here's how it works, in four simple steps.

00:00:10.143 --> 00:00:12.418
Step one. Join as a partner.

00:00:12.418 --> 00:00:14.542
Your workspace opens straight away.

00:00:14.652 --> 00:00:16.752
Step two. Add your place.

00:00:16.772 --> 00:00:18.542
Upload photos, describe it,

00:00:18.562 --> 00:00:20.242
and set your price per night.

00:00:20.352 --> 00:00:22.387
Step three. We check it.

00:00:22.407 --> 00:00:23.667
Who owns it, who's allowed

00:00:23.667 --> 00:00:25.212
to let it, and we visit to

00:00:25.212 --> 00:00:27.146
make sure the photos are real.

00:00:27.256 --> 00:00:28.661
Only then does your home

00:00:28.681 --> 00:00:30.707
go live for guests to find.

00:00:30.817 --> 00:00:33.162
Step four. Guests send you requests.

00:00:33.182 --> 00:00:35.982
You choose. Accept, or decline.

00:00:36.002 --> 00:00:38.039
Nothing is booked without your yes.

00:00:38.149 --> 00:00:39.504
When you accept, the guest

00:00:39.524 --> 00:00:41.824
has forty-eight hours to pay.

00:00:41.824 --> 00:00:43.549
The booking is only confirmed

00:00:43.549 --> 00:00:45.580
once the payment is verified.

00:00:45.690 --> 00:00:47.070
Guests pay our service fee

00:00:47.090 --> 00:00:48.520
on top of your price.

00:00:48.540 --> 00:00:50.334
It never comes out of your rate.

00:00:50.444 --> 00:00:52.369
Your exact address stays private

00:00:52.369 --> 00:00:54.449
until the guest has paid.

00:00:54.469 --> 00:00:56.519
And a refundable caution deposit

00:00:56.519 --> 00:00:58.095
helps protect your home.

00:00:58.205 --> 00:00:59.585
Your bookings and earnings

00:00:59.605 --> 00:01:01.130
live in one place.

00:01:01.130 --> 00:01:02.655
We verify your identity

00:01:02.655 --> 00:01:04.278
before your first payout.

00:01:04.388 --> 00:01:06.243
Your home. Your rules.

00:01:06.263 --> 00:01:07.593
Verified guests.

00:01:07.613 --> 00:01:09.528
List your property on HAMLET.
